# openOODA x86 Emit Dead-Arms Audit

File: openOODA/audit/x86-dead-arms.oot
Status: open — Tier 5 #24 chain audit, Turn 1 refactor candidate inventory.
Context: Dispatch ladder at ooda/oodac/x86_emit.oo:73-196 spans 24 token-walker arms. Turn 2 plans to replace it with a single call to x86_ast_typed.oo:43.

---

## 1. Inventory

24 arms live in the chain. Each is a `let` + `if` pair, plus an `else`-style return chain on miss.

